  - 'The charge deals <color=#FD3971>60%</color> damage (<color=#FD3971>+50%</color> on a wall slam) and Stuns. A wall slam bursts a <color=#FD3971>3m</color> Stun shockwave for <color=#FD3971>80%</color>.'
